{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Big Decisions", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Taking a Risk", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about backgrounds in a wider variety of communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Modals for Possibility and Necessity", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals when you want to express possibility and necessity.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">You use <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span> and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to express possibility in the past and in the future.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "*<span class=\"italic\">Might </span>suggests that something is less possible than <span class=\"italic\">may</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">might </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">might not</span> + infinitive</li><li><span class=\"italic\">could </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">could not</span> + infinitive</li><li><span class=\"italic\">may </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">may not</span> + infinitive</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Expressing Necessity</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">must </span>or <span class=\"italic\">have to</span> to express that something is necessarily true. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I must weigh my options.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I might study floristry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It could be problematic to find a job, but it's what I really revel in doing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You have to make enough money to pay your bills. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I must weigh my options carefully.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Don't make any hasty decisions that you may regret later.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Negative Questions To Encourage Agreement", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Negative questions have a different meaning than regular questions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use negative questions to confirm information you already know, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think ... ?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Negative questions can have two different meanings. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can ask a negative question for confirmation of a positive belief. <br/>You can ask a negative question for confirmation of a negative belief.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't you think that would be a good choice for me?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Isn't it difficult to find work in floristry?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "And don't they say you should find work doing what you love? ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "floristry ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the business of growing or selling flowers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I might study floristry, I'm very interested in flowers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about making an important decision.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "problematic ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult to solve or do", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It could be problematic to find a job, but it's what I really want.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "come to a decision", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get to a point where you know what to do", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I haven't come to a final decision yet, I still have to think it over. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to weigh one's options", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to think carefully about different options in order to come to a decision", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I haven't made a decision yet, I must weigh my options carefully.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to revel in", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel intense pleasure or interest for something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(phrasal verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know it can be hard to find a job, but it's what I really revel in doing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hasty ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that is done or made very quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't make any hasty decisions that you may regret later.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take the plunge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to commit to something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: But at some point I will just have to take the plunge and go for it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "prudent ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "careful or wise in practical matters", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Be prudent. Make your decision only once you've considered all your options. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob05aud