ype": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le18ob05re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le18ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le18ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le18ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: They said it will be a twenty-minute wait for a table.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Okay. I don't mind waiting. I ate a big breakfast.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So, you haven't mentioned what you would like to study. Do you have any ideas?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I do. I might study floristry. Don't you think that would be a good choice for me?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Floristry? I'm not sure. Isn't it difficult to find work in floristry?"}, {"time": "21000", "image": "engenn8le18ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, you're right. It could be really problematic to find a job, but it's what I really revel in doing.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh! I had no idea you were so interested in flowers!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: And don't they say you should find work doing what you love?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Of course! But don't forget, you have to make enough money to pay your bills.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I haven't come to a final decision yet. I must weigh my options carefully."}, {"time": "42600", "image": "engenn8le18ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely. Don't make any hasty decisions that you may regret later.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I won't. I will give it a lot of thought before I decide. But at some point I will just have to take the plunge and go for it. Don't they say you never regret what you do, only what you don't do?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, for sure. But only after you've carefully considered all your options.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, Vanessa. You're so prudent!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let's go! Our table is ready."}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}